    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "When 29-year-old Clarisse Le Guernic first arrived in Shanghai, she didn’t just fall in love with its "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "skyline",
            "ref": "v-skyline"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". She fell for the stories hidden behind it. Today, this young French woman has become one of Shanghai’s most creative “city walk” designers, helping people explore the city in new ways."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Le Guernic, who uses the Chinese name Le Gaixi, studied Chinese in France and later earned a master’s degree in tourism in Ningbo. She began designing walking tours for locals in Shanghai in 2022. She conducted "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "extensive",
            "ref": "v-extensive"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " research and tested every route herself to ensure the tours were "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "engaging",
            "zh": "有趣的"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "One of her most popular tours is based on the comic "
          },
          {
            "t": "em",
            "v": "The Adventures of Tintin: The Blue Lotus"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "",
            "zh": "《丁丁历险记：蓝莲花》"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". The story is set in 1930s Shanghai. Le Guernic discovered many real locations from the book, such as an Indian-staffed police station. “About 80 per cent of the comic is based on real events,” she said. “You can still find "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "traces",
            "ref": "v-trace"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " of them in today’s Shanghai.”"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "i1",
        "type": "imageRef",
        "image": "img1"
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "At first, some locals were "
          },
          {
            "t": "underline",
            "v": "hesitant"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " to join a tour led by a foreigner. But after hearing her speak fluent Chinese and tell interesting stories, they quickly changed their minds. “She knows my childhood city walk routes even better than I do,” said one local with a smile."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Le Guernic has loved the Chinese language and culture since she was 12. She first came to China in 2012 and studied at Fudan University as an "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "exchange student",
            "zh": "交换生"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " from 2015 to 2016. After graduating in 2019, she decided to make Shanghai her home."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p6",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Le Guernic smiles and says, “I was born in France but made in China.” With each tour, she proves that love for a city has no "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "borders",
            "ref": "v-border"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". All it takes is a pair of open eyes and an open heart."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
